      "text_raw": "In this Chapter switched-\ncapacitor techniques have\nbeen introduced. Consider-\nable attention is paid to the\ncapacitors, switches and\nopamps required to build\nsuch filters.\nAlso the limitations are\ndiscussed such as mismatch,\nclock injection, charge redis-\ntribution and noise.\nFinally a short compari-\nson with switched-current\nfilters is given.\nSeveral more types of fil-\nters are available on silicon.\nContinuous-time filters are\nnext.",
